    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d748">

                <pb facs="0883" n="789" xml:id="pg789"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Williams to Mr. Uhl.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-11-29"><hi rendition="#italic">November 29,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Trial of Sanguily commenced yesterday noon; adjourned at 5 o’clock; resumed
                    to-day noon and finished at 3 o’clock. I attended as spectator in compliance
                    with instructions of Department. His advocate, Viondi, has made a magnificient
                    defense. Verdict not rendered yet.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
